  "semantic": {
    "lines": [
      "Wow! Im very pleased with your battle against",
      "Fury. You've fought well and can call yourself",
      "a \"Hero\". This time i'll summon a balanced Fury.",
      "",
      "I'll try to summon Fury using all my willpower.",
      "This Fury will have similar power that i've ",
      "fought long time ago. So put your best on this ",
      "battle.",
      "",
      "Once you moved to the training stage, you can't ",
      "use core to come out. So you better prepare ",
      "for death in this battle.",
      "",
      "I'll move you to the training stage if you are ready."
    ]
  },
